      "statement": "North Carolina homeowners underwriting uses a three-layer boundary: the appetite guide and Rule 550 are internal eligibility, referral, evidence, and authority controls; NCDOI-2018-03 and NCDOI-2021-06 govern disclosure and claims administration; and HO 01 32 controls only the contract provisions it changes when attached.",
