      "statement": "The internal NC claims handoff opens and documents the claim promptly, verifies the policy package, protects property, uses a seven-day-after-discovery mitigation checkpoint and a 60-day suspected-water-backup intake target when practicable, investigates cause and scope, requests relevant evidence, escalates complex or adverse matters, and closes only after known issues are resolved.",
