      "statement": "For the applicable NC contract and claims bulletin, claim receipt is acknowledged within 30 days, a claim is accepted or rejected within 30 business days after needed requested items are received, and an accepted claim is paid within 30 business days after payment becomes due; written decisions must identify relevant policy provisions and material facts.",
